1
00:00:00,353 --> 00:00:03,023
(Sheldon:)I'm all but certain there's a Nobel Prize
in my future.

2
00:00:03,190 --> 00:00:06,110
(Sheldon:)Actually, I shouldn't say that.
I'm entirely certain.

3
00:00:07,944 --> 00:00:12,154
(Sheldon:)No, Mother, I could not feel
your church group praying for my safety.

4
00:00:12,324 --> 00:00:14,364
(Sheldon:)The fact that I'm home safe
doesn't prove it worked.

5
00:00:14,534 --> 00:00:17,414
(Sheldon:)That logic is post hoc
ergo propter hoc.

6
00:00:18,538 --> 00:00:21,998
(Sheldon:)No, I'm not sassing you
in Eskimo talk.

7
00:00:23,085 --> 00:00:25,965
-I'm gonna let Penny know we're back.
-Mother, I have to go.

8
00:00:26,129 --> 00:00:28,589
(Sheldon:)Yeah, love you. Bye.

9
00:00:29,508 --> 00:00:31,338
(Sheldon:)Hello, old friend.

10
00:00:34,679 --> 00:00:36,009
[SIGHS]

11
00:00:39,810 --> 00:00:41,690
(Sheldon:)Daddy's home.

12
00:00:44,314 --> 00:00:45,694
(Penny:)Leonard, you're back.

13
00:00:45,857 --> 00:00:48,067
(Leonard:)Yeah, I just stopped by to say--

14
00:00:53,115 --> 00:00:55,035
(Leonard:)-Yeah, so hi.
-Hi.

15
00:01:03,458 --> 00:01:07,088
Damn it, I should've gone over
and told her we were back.

16
00:01:11,758 --> 00:01:17,018
(Raj:)Yeah, it was first come, first serve.

